{"obsah":"<p>We are currently processing photos from the shoot of Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček's new bike, taken by Říčany photo legend Ruda Flachs. In dust, sweat and mosquitoes they completed a shoot that will gradually be posted on social media.</p>\n\n<p>For our team the weekend was all about exhibitions and holidays. Martin Šimůnek was performing in Hradec Králové and Vlasta with Lukáš Valný in Rumburk. Both days it was absolutely pouring…, but huge respect to the organisers who carried on, and all the events went ahead. Sometimes you just have to ride in the wet.</p>\n\n<p>We have a few photos in the gallery, but nothing to write home about.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-08-22-v-13.55.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-08-22-v-13.55.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211641\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-08-22-v-13.55.42.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2022-08-22-v-13.55.42.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211640\"/></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FR6_4057.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FR6_4057.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211643\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FR6_3626.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FR6_3626.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211644\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FR6_4568.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FR6_4568.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211646\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FR6_4157.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F08%2FR6_4157.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211645\"/></a></figure>\n</figure>"}